<div class="page-wrapper">
    <NavBanner />
    <div id="cards" class="main-wrapper">
      <section class="section-hero case-study">
        <div id="banner-trigger" class="nav_banner-trigger"></div>
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 w-container">
          <div class="wrapper-hero flex middle-align">
            <div class="left-hero max-640">
              <div class="gap-4">
                <div class="w-layout-hflex flex-block-2">
                  <a href="#" class="text-caps">Customer stories</a>
                  <div class="text-caps">&gt;</div>
                  <div class="text-caps">Dove hero</div>
                </div>
                <h1 class="h1"><span class="span-pink-2">Dove Hero: </span>Make marketing simple and accessible for your real estate business</h1>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80">DoveHero is the all-in-one marketing tool built to help businesses grow <br>by making campaigns easier and more efficient. As one of our<br>
                  <a href="https://www.motiontheagency.com/blog/getting-the-best-out-of-daas-communication-priorities-and-value" class="link-20">subscription </a>clients, DoveHero has a user-friendly platform that brings <br>together email marketing, SMS, and WhatsApp campaigns, letting you reach<br>thousands of contacts without the hassle. It’s all about saving time, <br>working smarter, and driving real results without the extra stress.
                </div>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 hide">This wasn’t just about a fresh logo; it was about crafting a brand and digital presence that matched their ambition, stood out in the competitive AI space, and resonated with their target audience.</div>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 hide">Through close collaboration and iterative feedback, we partnered with them to launch their new identity and create a powerful foundation for growth, ensuring their brand reflected their evolution and their goals as a startup.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="case-study-tab">
                <div class="info-wrapper">
                  <div class="gap-16-subscription gap-52">
                    <div class="gap-16-subscription-2">
                      <div class="case-study-tab-wrapper">
                        <div class="flex-8-subscription">
                          <div class="ic-text-subscription-2"><img src="/images/type-icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="case-study-tab-icon">
                            <div class="text-14-150">Project type</div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="h3 mobile-16">Subscription</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex-8-subscription hide">
                          <div class="ic-text-subscription-2"><img src="/images/cost.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="case-study-tab-icon">
                            <div class="text-14-150">Project Cost</div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="h3 mobile-16">$19,000</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex-8-subscription">
                          <div class="ic-text-subscription-2"><img src="/images/time.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="case-study-tab-icon">
                            <div class="text-14-150">Project timeline</div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="h3 mobile-16"><strong> 12 months</strong></div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-w-id="a4d8dbad-85c5-de77-8404-4042222bdb2e" class="absolute-img-copy"><img src="/images/hero_2.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 728px, 940px" srcset="/images/hero_2-p-500.png 500w, /images/hero_2.avif 1872w" alt="A cell phone is sitting on top of a computer screen" class="image-sharpish"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section-process padding-btm-80">
        <div class="line-gradient-2"></div><img src="/images/Frame-1707478761_1.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 3201px) 100vw, 3201px" srcset="/images/Frame-1707478761_1Frame-1707478761.avif 800w, /images/Frame-1707478761_1.avif 3201w" alt="A black and white photo of the moon and stars" class="image-process-2">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 m-container-purpose w-container">
          <div class="wrapper-purpose">
            <div class="top-purpose">
              <div class="left-top-purpose">
                <div class="gap-4-purpose">
                  <div class="text-12-caps opacity-60">Project Scope</div>
                  <div>
                    <h2 class="h1">Project <span class="span-pink-2">overview</span></h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-16-150 opacity-80">DoveHero, as a marketing tool, needed a dynamic and interactive website to showcase its brand identity. The challenge was to strike the right balance between providing clear information about DoveHero’s services while keeping visitors engaged with visually compelling and interactive elements, including an <a href="/services/explainer-video" class="link-19">explainer video</a>, <a href="/services/lottie" class="link-18">Lottie animation</a>, and <a href="/services/ui-design" class="link-17">website design</a>.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card-contaiiner">
              <div style="padding-top:56.17021276595745%" class="ai-engineer-vid w-video w-embed"><iframe class="embedly-embed" src="https://cdn.embedly.com/widgets/media.html?src=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fembed%2Fr0sBdeyGN5o%3Ffeature%3Doembed&display_name=YouTube&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3Dr0sBdeyGN5o&image=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2Fr0sBdeyGN5o%2Fhqdefault.jpg&type=text%2Fhtml&schema=youtube" width="940" height="528" scrolling="no" allowfullscreen="" title="DoveHero | 3Os Product Explainer | 2D Animated Motion Graphics"></iframe></div>
            </div>
            <div class="bottom_purpose grid-4">
              <div class="card-contaiiner">
                <div class="card">
                  <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="gap-28-purpose height-auto"><img src="/images/brand-identity_1.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 728px, 940px" srcset="/images/brand-identity_1brand-identity.avif 500w, /images/brand-identity_1brand-identity.avif 800w, /images/brand-identity_1.avif 1623w" alt="A circular object with a bird on it" class="img-purpose">
                      <div class="gap-20-center-purpose left-small">
                        <h3 class="h3">Brand identity</h3>
                        <div class="text-14-150 opacity-80">As we worked with DoveHero over time, we saw them grow into a brand that needed to stand out in a crowded market. We helped them create a bold, distinct presence that not only sets them apart but also connects with their values and the audience they want to reach.</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-contaiiner">
                <div class="card">
                  <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="gap-28-purpose height-auto"><img src="/images/web-design_1.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 728px, 940px" srcset="/images/web-design_1-p-500.png 500w, /images/web-design_1.avif 1622w" alt="A black square object with a bird on it" class="img-purpose">
                      <div class="gap-20-center-purpose left-small">
                        <h3 class="h3">Website design</h3>
                        <div class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We brought DoveHero’s dream website to life, building it from the ground up to ensure a seamless experience. Every detail was designed with their audience in mind, making navigation effortless while helping visitors learn more about DoveHero and build trust in the brand.</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-contaiiner">
                <div class="card">
                  <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="gap-28-purpose height-auto"><img src="/images/lottie-anim.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 728px, 940px" srcset="/images/lottie-anim-p-500.png 500w, /images/lottie-anim.avif 1622w" alt="" class="img-purpose">
